# gpos-demo image build context (UC1-BUILD-SPEC 12.1, 12.2): whitelist.
# Only the app code, its pins, the Showcase protos, master data and the policy go in.
# Never spikes/, research/, build/, mesh/, k8s/, scripts/, postgres/, .env*, .venv/,
# and never any GEBIT material (descriptor sets are mounted at runtime only).
*
!app/Dockerfile
!app/requirements.txt
!app/gposdemo
!proto
!data
!policy
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/.env*
**/*.pb
**/*.zip
